## ⚠️ Important Note About Accounts

This version has **no server**. Accounts and data are saved only in the browser of the device where you sign up, so you cannot log in from another device, no verification codes are sent, and there is no password reset yet.

**Next step:** connect a service such as Firebase or Supabase for real email/phone sign-up, verification and syncing.

